WEBVTT

00:00:17.660 --> 00:00:22.520
(Based on Mo Xiang Tong Xiu's novel
of the same name)

00:00:22.740 --> 00:00:27.180
(Adult Supervision Is Recommended)

00:00:35.650 --> 00:00:37.180
It takes a lot of spiritual energy
to cast this talisman.

00:00:37.460 --> 00:00:39.640
They wanted to take Xue Yang away
even when he is already dead.

00:00:40.260 --> 00:00:43.020
The Stygian Tiger Amulet
must be with Xue Yang.

00:01:11.760 --> 00:01:14.439
=The Founder of Diabolism=
(The Final Chapter)

00:01:14.940 --> 00:01:16.020
♪As such♪

00:01:16.100 --> 00:01:19.900
♪I will grant your chivalry♪

00:01:21.060 --> 00:01:22.060
♪As such♪

00:01:22.300 --> 00:01:26.460
♪I search for you in my memories,
I yearn for you to remember♪

00:01:26.860 --> 00:01:29.900
♪The green hills, the bamboo forests,
and the clouds in the sky♪

00:01:30.340 --> 00:01:32.820
♪Everywhere♪

00:01:32.980 --> 00:01:38.900
♪I regret not the time
we spent together♪

00:01:39.180 --> 00:01:44.900
♪Awakening the promise never forgotten♪

00:01:45.340 --> 00:01:50.580
♪A song of love and sorrow♪

00:01:51.500 --> 00:01:57.500
♪A cherished love♪

00:01:57.660 --> 00:02:03.140
♪Can never be parted♪

00:02:03.780 --> 00:02:09.540
♪We shared wine and sorrows
underneath the moonlight♪

00:02:09.900 --> 00:02:18.500
♪I will walk with you
to the end of the world♪

00:02:18.560 --> 00:02:24.960
=The Founder of Diabolism=
(The Final Chapter)

00:02:25.370 --> 00:02:28.250
=Episode 4=
(Getting Drunk)

00:02:33.810 --> 00:02:35.530
Xiao Xingchen, the Moon in Breeze.

00:02:36.420 --> 00:02:38.170
Song Zichen, the Gentry Despite Frost.

00:02:39.260 --> 00:02:41.090
Such honorable and virtuous men.

00:02:41.900 --> 00:02:42.980
What a shame.

00:02:43.360 --> 00:02:44.450
What a pity.

00:02:45.330 --> 00:02:47.240
No matter how far apart,

00:02:47.540 --> 00:02:48.900
they will meet again.

00:02:53.479 --> 00:02:54.439
Lan Zhan.

00:03:13.580 --> 00:03:15.040
Miss Qing.

00:03:15.040 --> 00:03:16.920
Taoist Xiao Xingchen.

00:03:20.840 --> 00:03:23.300
Hanguang-jun,
aren't you going to stop them?

00:03:23.500 --> 00:03:24.480
You go.

00:03:25.810 --> 00:03:26.480
All right.

00:03:26.480 --> 00:03:28.480
I'll help you to teach them a lesson.

00:03:28.680 --> 00:03:31.340
Hey, kids! You are disciples
from cultivator clans.

00:03:31.340 --> 00:03:32.690
What's the use of burning joss paper?

00:03:32.690 --> 00:03:34.730
They're dead.
They won't be able to receive them.

00:03:35.160 --> 00:03:36.920
There are people living nearby.

00:03:36.920 --> 00:03:37.650
If you guys keep burning...

00:03:37.650 --> 00:03:38.730
You've never died!

00:03:38.730 --> 00:03:40.280
How do you know if they will
be able to receive them or not?

00:03:41.780 --> 00:03:43.730
How do I know? Well, I...

00:03:44.610 --> 00:03:45.920
Even if the dead can't receive any joss paper,

00:03:45.920 --> 00:03:48.240
it must be because no one bothered
to send them any.

00:03:49.380 --> 00:03:50.380
No way.

00:03:50.850 --> 00:03:52.680
Was I such a failure in life?

00:03:52.940 --> 00:03:54.640
That no one missed me
or bothered to send me joss paper?

00:03:55.520 --> 00:03:57.780
Lan Zhan, at least you...

00:04:00.040 --> 00:04:02.040
We were classmates for three months.

00:04:02.040 --> 00:04:04.040
And we even shared a life
and death encounter in Muxi Mountain.

00:04:04.040 --> 00:04:06.370
And never once have you thought of me?

00:04:06.370 --> 00:04:08.140
No joss paper either?

00:04:10.130 --> 00:04:11.250
No need.

00:04:17.410 --> 00:04:19.660
How is the investigation
on the corpse coming along?

00:04:19.720 --> 00:04:20.720
The corpse?

00:04:38.360 --> 00:04:40.560
The right arm and the Demonic Left Arm
are from one corpse.

00:04:41.620 --> 00:04:43.000
All of them belong to "Good Brother".

00:04:43.450 --> 00:04:45.000
"Good Brother"?

00:04:46.640 --> 00:04:49.600
Well, we have to call that poor
dismembered corpse something, don't we?

00:04:50.320 --> 00:04:52.000
There are whip marks on both his legs.

00:04:52.160 --> 00:04:53.400
And

00:04:53.900 --> 00:04:55.820
given Xue Yang's vengeful character,

00:04:56.360 --> 00:04:58.370
this dismembered
and re-attached body is most likely...

00:04:59.060 --> 00:05:00.370
Chang Ci'an.

00:05:01.740 --> 00:05:03.540
Ripping Good Brother's soul into pieces

00:05:03.540 --> 00:05:05.240
and experimenting on Huaicang Mountain.

00:05:05.240 --> 00:05:06.920
All of these should be Xue Yang's doing.

00:05:07.380 --> 00:05:08.920
And those assassins

00:05:09.680 --> 00:05:11.380
followed us all the way to Yi City.

00:05:11.970 --> 00:05:13.420
But they only took Xue Yang with them.

00:05:18.490 --> 00:05:19.970
I think even they don't know

00:05:20.330 --> 00:05:22.600
the exact location of Good Brother's
right arm and other parts.

00:05:23.240 --> 00:05:25.020
Many called for Xue Yang to be punished

00:05:25.040 --> 00:05:26.380
for the massacre of the Chang Clan back then.

00:05:26.690 --> 00:05:28.380
Xue Yang is deceitful and cautious.

00:05:28.680 --> 00:05:30.120
He must have kept tricks up his sleeve.

00:05:30.120 --> 00:05:30.780
So...

00:05:32.000 --> 00:05:34.060
Hiding the whereabouts
of Good Brother's right arm and other parts

00:05:34.060 --> 00:05:35.810
must be one of them.

00:05:36.260 --> 00:05:37.210
That's true.

00:05:37.210 --> 00:05:38.720
And with the Stygian Tiger Amulet
in his hands,

00:05:39.060 --> 00:05:40.720
many would hesitate

00:05:40.720 --> 00:05:42.260
to deal with him without a plan.

00:05:43.760 --> 00:05:45.530
What do you think about the mastermind

00:05:45.530 --> 00:05:46.500
behind those assassins?

00:05:47.810 --> 00:05:49.460
There are only a handful of people

00:05:49.720 --> 00:05:51.460
who could know
that Xue Yang was alive

00:05:51.820 --> 00:05:53.360
and had the Stygian Tiger Amulet
in his possession.

00:06:07.930 --> 00:06:11.450
It's about time the mastermind
behind the cat corpse incidents

00:06:11.860 --> 00:06:13.450
wraps up the game.

00:06:14.330 --> 00:06:15.810
Hey, kids!

00:06:16.090 --> 00:06:17.810
- We're not your kids!
- We're not your kids!

00:06:18.900 --> 00:06:19.810
Did you guys find out
about anything else

00:06:19.810 --> 00:06:21.240
regarding the cat corpse incident?

00:06:21.680 --> 00:06:23.940
I mapped the locations

00:06:23.940 --> 00:06:25.700
where the cat corpse incidents occurred,

00:06:25.700 --> 00:06:26.960
and they all appeared to be in a line

00:06:26.960 --> 00:06:28.260
pointed straight to Yi City.

00:06:28.840 --> 00:06:31.560
Except for one place.

00:06:32.420 --> 00:06:34.290
Oh? And where is that?

00:06:35.940 --> 00:06:38.780
(Yunmeng)

00:06:39.140 --> 00:06:42.740
(Yunping City)

00:06:46.090 --> 00:06:47.810
Oh, going to the temple again?

00:06:47.810 --> 00:06:48.900
Yes.

00:07:00.690 --> 00:07:01.600
My vegetables!

00:07:05.060 --> 00:07:08.530
- Oh, my. That scared me.
- What's going on here?

00:07:11.970 --> 00:07:13.050
Apple?

00:07:13.370 --> 00:07:14.440
Fairy?

00:07:15.357 --> 00:07:16.047
Fairy!

00:07:19.770 --> 00:07:20.560
Mo Xuanyu,

00:07:20.560 --> 00:07:22.410
look what your dumb donkey did!

00:07:23.490 --> 00:07:25.920
I... I haven't even said anything
about your dog yet!

00:07:25.920 --> 00:07:27.500
It bit my donkey first!

00:07:28.250 --> 00:07:30.330
How dare you compare your donkey
to my spiritual dog?

00:07:30.330 --> 00:07:32.330
My uncle gave me Fairy!

00:07:33.520 --> 00:07:35.420
Don't try to bring up Lianfang-zun.

00:07:35.420 --> 00:07:37.500
Hanguang-jun gave me Apple.

00:07:37.780 --> 00:07:38.700
- No way!
- That's impossible!

00:07:39.180 --> 00:07:40.700
There's no way
Hanguang-jun gave Apple to you.

00:07:43.760 --> 00:07:45.840
It... It can't be true, right?

00:07:46.060 --> 00:07:47.570
There, there, Apple.

00:07:47.570 --> 00:07:49.930
We'll take you back to Cloud Recesses
to take care of your wounds right away.

00:07:50.370 --> 00:07:51.290
- No way!
- You can't!

00:07:51.420 --> 00:07:54.330
Your donkey is too noisy! The seniors
can't concentrate with it there!

00:07:54.540 --> 00:07:57.000
We wouldn't have
brought it along with us otherwise.

00:07:59.260 --> 00:08:00.370
So dumb.

00:08:01.120 --> 00:08:02.850
Who are you calling dumb?
You're the one who is dumb!

00:08:02.850 --> 00:08:04.040
I meant the donkey.

00:08:04.040 --> 00:08:05.760
It would not be my fault
if you thought I was talking about you.

00:08:05.760 --> 00:08:06.480
You...

00:08:09.540 --> 00:08:10.240
Noisy.

00:08:21.050 --> 00:08:22.200
There sure are
a lot of observation towers

00:08:22.200 --> 00:08:23.820
for a town this size.

00:08:26.560 --> 00:08:28.320
Hanguang-jun. Senior Mo.

00:08:28.800 --> 00:08:30.200
The cat corpses were discovered

00:08:30.200 --> 00:08:32.380
around the area of the Guanyin Temple.

00:08:33.140 --> 00:08:34.770
However, I didn't manage to find any clues

00:08:34.770 --> 00:08:36.050
inside the temple.

00:08:38.700 --> 00:08:41.700
(Guanyin Temple)

00:08:41.700 --> 00:08:47.500
(Peace and Blessings)

00:08:48.810 --> 00:08:50.720
Temples are often built
within mountains.

00:08:51.210 --> 00:08:53.760
It is rare to see one located in a city.

00:08:54.900 --> 00:08:56.850
And it has plenty of visitors too.

00:09:00.580 --> 00:09:01.460
(Wisdom and Insight)

00:09:35.250 --> 00:09:36.340
What's the matter?

00:09:36.370 --> 00:09:36.783
(Wisdom and Insight)

00:09:36.820 --> 00:09:37.780
Hanguang-jun,

00:09:37.780 --> 00:09:40.130
why don't we stay
in the city for the night?

00:09:41.660 --> 00:09:42.500
All right.

00:09:43.440 --> 00:09:45.240
Jingyi and I will
go make the arrangements.

00:09:45.560 --> 00:09:46.160
Mm.

00:09:46.193 --> 00:09:52.900
(Guanyin Temple)

00:09:58.039 --> 00:09:59.039
Let it go higher.

00:10:07.860 --> 00:10:09.780
That's mine.

00:10:09.780 --> 00:10:11.250
Could you give it back to me, please?

00:10:11.580 --> 00:10:12.730
Thank you.

00:10:12.900 --> 00:10:14.820
(Stygian Tiger Amulet)

00:10:19.530 --> 00:10:20.840
"Yiling Patriarch"!

00:10:20.840 --> 00:10:22.610
Hurry up! Come on!

00:10:22.960 --> 00:10:24.100
Coming!

00:10:24.560 --> 00:10:26.020
Did you see that, Lan Zhan?

00:10:26.020 --> 00:10:27.860
The rock is the "Stygian Tiger Amulet".

00:10:27.860 --> 00:10:30.010
That wooden stick must be "Nostalgia".

00:10:34.420 --> 00:10:36.220
- Hurry up.
- Let me do it!

00:10:40.100 --> 00:10:41.260
Take this!

00:10:45.360 --> 00:10:46.740
Oh, the "Sunshot Campaign".

00:10:48.570 --> 00:10:50.290
The "sun" fell on its own.

00:10:50.290 --> 00:10:51.570
Who will be the "leader" next?

00:10:51.570 --> 00:10:52.890
Me, of course.

00:10:52.890 --> 00:10:54.300
I'm "Jin Guangyao".

00:10:54.300 --> 00:10:56.360
I killed the evil leader of the Wen Clan.

00:10:57.040 --> 00:10:58.010
No way.

00:10:58.210 --> 00:11:00.450
"Nie Mingjue" fought the most wars
and won the most battles.

00:11:00.450 --> 00:11:01.460
I am the true leader!

00:11:02.120 --> 00:11:03.380
But I'm the "Chief Cultivator"...

00:11:03.380 --> 00:11:04.640
So what?

00:11:04.640 --> 00:11:06.810
You would still turn tail and run away
when you see me!

00:11:07.300 --> 00:11:10.330
"Xichen", "Mingjue" wants to hit me again.

00:11:10.330 --> 00:11:12.360
All right. That's enough.

00:11:12.760 --> 00:11:14.360
I'm the "Yiling Patriarch".

00:11:14.360 --> 00:11:15.610
I'm the most powerful!

00:11:15.740 --> 00:11:17.720
I suppose I'll take up the burden

00:11:17.720 --> 00:11:19.290
of becoming the leader.

00:11:20.020 --> 00:11:20.930
No way!

00:11:20.930 --> 00:11:22.260
I'm the Three Poisons Sage,
"Jiang Cheng"!

00:11:22.260 --> 00:11:23.730
I'm the most powerful!

00:11:24.460 --> 00:11:26.420
You've never won against me!

00:11:26.420 --> 00:11:28.420
How dare you say

00:11:28.420 --> 00:11:29.850
that you're the most powerful?

00:11:32.330 --> 00:11:33.560
How dare I?

00:11:33.560 --> 00:11:35.180
Don't you remember how you died?

00:11:45.399 --> 00:11:46.440
(Stygian Tiger Amulet)

00:11:47.940 --> 00:11:49.420
Hey! Why did you guys push me?

00:11:50.440 --> 00:11:52.170
It was many against one!

00:11:52.170 --> 00:11:53.300
That's not fair!

00:12:02.160 --> 00:12:03.610
Thank you, Mister.

00:12:05.370 --> 00:12:06.520
These are for you.

00:12:18.120 --> 00:12:19.320
Come on, Lan Zhan.

00:12:22.740 --> 00:12:26.780
(Liquor)

00:12:28.520 --> 00:12:30.800
It has been so long since
I've had authentic Yunmeng cuisine!

00:12:33.040 --> 00:12:34.120
What is the matter?

00:12:36.840 --> 00:12:38.540
I miss drinking with someone.

00:12:38.540 --> 00:12:40.180
I've brought you wine.

00:12:40.180 --> 00:12:42.530
(He Home-brew)
Here. Our famous He Home-brew.

00:12:42.530 --> 00:12:43.460
It's strong.

00:12:43.460 --> 00:12:45.020
If you don't get drunk off a jar,
I'll take your surname.

00:12:46.330 --> 00:12:47.360
Give me five jars, then.

00:12:47.820 --> 00:12:49.460
Very well, sir. Coming right up.

00:12:50.500 --> 00:12:51.290
Ten jars.

00:12:51.290 --> 00:12:52.330
Huh?

00:12:54.140 --> 00:12:55.540
You wanted to drink, right?

00:13:02.730 --> 00:13:05.130
Misters, you don't look
like you are from around here.

00:13:05.130 --> 00:13:07.410
Have you come to pay a visit
to the Guanyin Temple?

00:13:07.930 --> 00:13:10.640
Yes. Does it truly work miracles
if you pray there?

00:13:10.640 --> 00:13:12.010
Of course.

00:13:12.440 --> 00:13:13.420
Our Guanyin Temple

00:13:13.420 --> 00:13:15.680
was built by a person of importance
who happened to pass by the city

00:13:15.680 --> 00:13:17.680
and heeded the guidance
of heaven and earth.

00:13:18.040 --> 00:13:19.400
He is a very influential person.

00:13:19.810 --> 00:13:20.650
A person of significance?

00:13:21.100 --> 00:13:22.400
What is his name?

00:13:23.300 --> 00:13:24.400
Well, I'm not sure about that.

00:13:24.400 --> 00:13:26.130
But the temple definitely
works miracles.

00:13:26.130 --> 00:13:28.260
Otherwise, it wouldn't be able to suppress
those tainted beings and evil spirits.

00:13:31.660 --> 00:13:33.920
That place used to be

00:13:34.320 --> 00:13:36.120
a courtesan house, you know?

00:13:39.580 --> 00:13:41.000
What happened to it then?

00:13:41.740 --> 00:13:44.250
I'm not sure.
I heard it from someone else as well.

00:13:44.250 --> 00:13:46.170
There are a lot of stories
behind that temple.

00:13:46.420 --> 00:13:47.530
All the locals

00:13:47.530 --> 00:13:49.530
go to that temple to pray
for health and safety

00:13:49.530 --> 00:13:51.330
whenever we run into evil spirits
and other tainted beings.

00:13:52.260 --> 00:13:53.330
Evil spirits?

00:13:53.500 --> 00:13:55.330
This area is under the jurisdiction
of the Jiang Clan of Yunmeng.

00:13:55.530 --> 00:13:57.060
Why not just go to them?

00:13:57.060 --> 00:13:58.840
We wouldn't dare!

00:13:59.060 --> 00:14:00.410
Clan Leader Jiang

00:14:00.410 --> 00:14:02.080
has a terrifying temper.

00:14:02.080 --> 00:14:03.410
In order to capture a great devil,

00:14:03.410 --> 00:14:05.740
he often captures suspects
and tortures them at the Lotus Cove.

00:14:05.740 --> 00:14:08.890
You can hear those awful cries
from miles away!

00:14:09.610 --> 00:14:11.360
Oh, right! That great devil

00:14:11.360 --> 00:14:13.920
is the Yiling Patriarch,
"Wei Wuqian" or something.

00:14:21.960 --> 00:14:23.520
Mister, you sure can handle your liquor!

00:14:23.520 --> 00:14:26.580
You're the first person I've met who's able
to hold his own after finishing an entire jar!

00:14:26.580 --> 00:14:28.580
Mister, what is your surname?

00:14:28.730 --> 00:14:29.890
My...

00:14:31.620 --> 00:14:32.600
My surname is Lan.

00:14:33.450 --> 00:14:34.330
All right.

00:14:34.330 --> 00:14:35.440
From now on,

00:14:35.440 --> 00:14:36.890
my surname is Lan!

00:14:39.690 --> 00:14:40.320
Lan Zhan!

00:14:42.040 --> 00:14:42.900
That's a chili pepper!

00:14:45.930 --> 00:14:47.120
Quick. Drink some water.

00:14:50.380 --> 00:14:52.827
(He Home-brew)

00:14:52.890 --> 00:14:53.770
Lan Zhan.

00:15:01.700 --> 00:15:03.180
You're fine

00:15:03.600 --> 00:15:04.960
after drinking a whole cup of wine.

00:15:05.660 --> 00:15:07.320
Not bad, Lan Zhan.

00:15:15.180 --> 00:15:16.740
I can't believe the mighty Hanguang-jun

00:15:17.040 --> 00:15:18.640
got drunk after a single cup of wine.

00:15:19.330 --> 00:15:20.640
In that case,

00:15:21.580 --> 00:15:23.010
have a good night's sleep.

00:15:23.450 --> 00:15:25.010
I'll go check out that Guanyin Temple.

00:15:36.980 --> 00:15:37.690
Wen...

00:15:40.060 --> 00:15:41.760
What do you mean by "One should not
take one side of matters as the whole",

00:15:42.100 --> 00:15:43.520
and "Its creator might not have intended

00:15:43.520 --> 00:15:45.520
to use it for evil"?

00:15:45.940 --> 00:15:47.760
Xue Yang may be a monster,

00:15:47.760 --> 00:15:49.400
but Wei Ying
is worse of evil than he is!

00:15:49.850 --> 00:15:52.130
All of those who practice
demonic cultivation should be eliminated!

00:15:52.130 --> 00:15:53.760
They should all be eradicated!

00:15:54.720 --> 00:15:56.500
I'm not trying
to absolve Wei Wuxian of his deeds.

00:15:57.080 --> 00:15:58.240
I'm merely suggesting

00:15:58.560 --> 00:16:00.240
that we should not jump to conclusions

00:16:00.240 --> 00:16:01.880
before we learn the entire picture.

00:16:03.170 --> 00:16:04.800
"Don't jump to conclusions"?

00:16:05.040 --> 00:16:06.290
The murder at Qiongqi Road

00:16:06.290 --> 00:16:07.300
and the massacre at Nevernight City,

00:16:07.300 --> 00:16:09.010
all of those were done by
Wei Ying and the Ghost General!

00:16:09.620 --> 00:16:11.010
My parents died

00:16:11.010 --> 00:16:13.290
because of them! Is that not so?

00:16:16.090 --> 00:16:16.920
I'm sorry.

00:16:17.080 --> 00:16:18.460
I was thoughtless.

00:16:18.460 --> 00:16:19.660
I misspoke.

00:16:28.930 --> 00:16:29.880
I've told you.

00:16:30.200 --> 00:16:31.360
It wasn't your fault.

00:16:32.620 --> 00:16:33.810
Young Master.

00:16:36.370 --> 00:16:37.340
Wen Ning,

00:16:37.560 --> 00:16:38.970
one should remember their past.

00:16:39.380 --> 00:16:40.970
But they have to look forward
to the future as well.

00:16:47.000 --> 00:16:47.890
Wei Ying...

00:17:05.760 --> 00:17:06.760
Lan Zhan?

00:17:07.210 --> 00:17:08.560
You already sobered up?

00:17:21.740 --> 00:17:24.930
(His... His shoes were
put on the wrong way.)

00:17:27.540 --> 00:17:28.610
Hanguang-jun,

00:17:29.040 --> 00:17:30.610
how many fingers am I holding up?

00:17:38.740 --> 00:17:39.720
Young Master?

00:17:41.250 --> 00:17:42.340
Leave first, Wen Ning.

00:17:47.300 --> 00:17:49.760
Lan Zhan, you're drunk.

00:17:50.400 --> 00:17:51.140
No.

00:17:55.580 --> 00:17:56.970
Where are you going?

00:17:57.290 --> 00:17:58.380
Back to Gusu.

00:17:59.580 --> 00:18:00.820
Wait!

00:18:00.820 --> 00:18:01.570
Um...

00:18:01.570 --> 00:18:03.410
You don't want the kids

00:18:03.410 --> 00:18:05.170
to see us like this, do you?

00:18:11.360 --> 00:18:12.620
Hanguang-jun,

00:18:12.620 --> 00:18:14.620
you sure have some interesting things

00:18:14.620 --> 00:18:16.620
inside your sleeve.

00:18:18.890 --> 00:18:20.370
Do you not like any of them?

00:18:21.120 --> 00:18:22.680
Do you prefer joss paper?

00:18:24.400 --> 00:18:25.540
Joss paper

00:18:25.800 --> 00:18:27.170
is for the deceased.

00:18:27.420 --> 00:18:28.440
You are not.

00:18:30.410 --> 00:18:32.490
(So that's what he meant
when he said "no need".)

00:18:34.320 --> 00:18:35.450
I'm serious, Lan Zhan.

00:18:35.450 --> 00:18:37.680
If the kids saw us like this...

00:18:38.420 --> 00:18:40.660
Your reputation will be ruined!

00:18:47.320 --> 00:18:48.090
Look.

00:18:48.380 --> 00:18:49.260
Doesn't this remind you

00:18:49.440 --> 00:18:51.920
of the days back when we were studying
at the Cloud Recesses?

00:18:52.180 --> 00:18:53.620
Me, holding a jar of Emperor's Smile,

00:18:53.890 --> 00:18:55.250
and you, trying to capture me
to punish me.

00:19:22.940 --> 00:19:24.100
More?

00:19:25.060 --> 00:19:26.980
(He Home-brew)

00:19:30.600 --> 00:19:31.490
Lan Zhan,

00:19:32.100 --> 00:19:34.400
you're amazing when you're drunk.

00:19:39.900 --> 00:19:40.490
Lan Zhan,

00:19:40.720 --> 00:19:41.930
be good and stay here.

00:19:41.930 --> 00:19:43.490
When I settle matters here,

00:19:43.490 --> 00:19:44.810
I'll go back to Gusu with you,

00:19:44.810 --> 00:19:45.860
all right?

00:19:49.560 --> 00:19:50.360
Trust me.

00:20:00.980 --> 00:20:02.090
(I summon the spirits of the dead.)

00:20:02.660 --> 00:20:03.920
(Come forth.)

00:20:14.290 --> 00:20:16.090
Even that wasn't enough to summon them?

00:20:19.370 --> 00:20:20.480
An array.

00:20:21.480 --> 00:20:22.480
As expected.

00:20:23.000 --> 00:20:25.000
This is also an array taken from
my manual on demonic cultivation.

00:20:26.600 --> 00:20:29.540
This must be why the culprit behind
the cat corpses led us to Yunping City.

00:20:33.960 --> 00:20:35.340
This array may be complicated,

00:20:35.570 --> 00:20:37.340
but with the right derivation,

00:20:37.340 --> 00:20:38.970
one can still find its crux.

00:20:39.620 --> 00:20:41.130
Lan Zhan, do you have a piece of paper?

00:21:01.300 --> 00:21:02.300
All done.

00:21:27.380 --> 00:21:29.260
Oh, my. He sure got away fast.

00:21:30.540 --> 00:21:31.620
He stole something of mine.

00:21:31.700 --> 00:21:32.620
Aren't you going to go after him?

00:21:32.930 --> 00:21:34.000
It is an act.

00:21:34.200 --> 00:21:35.020
I will not go after him.

00:21:35.020 --> 00:21:36.760
Not bad, Lan Zhan.

00:21:37.020 --> 00:21:38.140
Even in this state,

00:21:38.140 --> 00:21:40.140
you could still tell
that I was pretending.

00:21:44.300 --> 00:21:47.120
These people want to use me
to find the crux of the array.

00:21:47.580 --> 00:21:49.490
But the person who set up the array
is also highly skilled.

00:21:49.490 --> 00:21:50.610
It'll take more than a day or two

00:21:50.610 --> 00:21:52.930
to find the crux.

00:21:53.970 --> 00:21:54.930
However,

00:21:55.130 --> 00:21:57.260
while the crux I marked was fake,

00:21:57.840 --> 00:21:59.840
this linking spell is not.

00:22:00.450 --> 00:22:01.290
This is what they call

00:22:02.120 --> 00:22:05.020
"Cast a long line
to lure in a big catch".

00:22:24.650 --> 00:22:25.810
♪The swallows♪

00:22:25.890 --> 00:22:26.930
♪Fly away♪

00:22:27.250 --> 00:22:29.050
♪Knowing the way back♪

00:22:29.490 --> 00:22:30.690
♪I strum the strings♪

00:22:30.770 --> 00:22:31.890
♪And play the song♪

00:22:32.050 --> 00:22:33.690
♪Wondering when you'll return♪

00:22:34.290 --> 00:22:35.530
♪Who is sighing♪

00:22:35.570 --> 00:22:36.570
♪In sorrow?♪

00:22:36.810 --> 00:22:38.890
♪The world is full of separation♪

00:22:39.170 --> 00:22:40.330
♪When all is said and done♪

00:22:40.410 --> 00:22:42.970
♪I cherish every moment we are together♪

00:22:43.970 --> 00:22:45.130
♪A toast♪

00:22:45.210 --> 00:22:46.410
♪To the lush mountains♪

00:22:46.530 --> 00:22:48.170
♪We sit in a boat,
gazing up to the moon♪

00:22:48.770 --> 00:22:49.930
♪A gentle mist blows♪

00:22:49.970 --> 00:22:51.050
♪On the shore♪

00:22:51.090 --> 00:22:53.130
♪How peaceful the world seems♪

00:22:53.450 --> 00:22:54.610
♪Who is playing the flute?♪

00:22:54.770 --> 00:22:55.930
♪Separated in our previous lives♪

00:22:56.050 --> 00:22:57.770
♪I can only hope to meet you again
come next life♪

00:22:58.330 --> 00:22:59.530
♪No amount of gold♪

00:22:59.610 --> 00:23:03.010
♪Although there is no wind,
my heart flutters♪

00:23:04.770 --> 00:23:06.650
♪I'll overcome all the obstacles♪

00:23:06.650 --> 00:23:09.370
♪To spend the rest of my life with you♪

00:23:09.810 --> 00:23:10.890
♪One dressed in white,
one clad in black♪

00:23:10.930 --> 00:23:14.090
♪Playing a song together♪

00:23:14.610 --> 00:23:16.210
♪As we watch the sunset♪

00:23:16.930 --> 00:23:18.650
♪Sharing a blissful moment♪

00:23:18.890 --> 00:23:22.650
♪Away from the troubles of the world♪

00:23:24.130 --> 00:23:25.970
♪I'll overcome all the obstacles♪

00:23:26.090 --> 00:23:28.410
♪To spend the rest of my life with you♪

00:23:29.050 --> 00:23:30.730
♪One dressed in white,
one clad in black♪

00:23:30.850 --> 00:23:33.410
♪Playing a song together♪

00:23:33.650 --> 00:23:35.610
♪As we watch the sunset♪

00:23:36.050 --> 00:23:37.810
♪Sharing a blissful moment♪

00:23:38.010 --> 00:23:41.170
♪Away from the troubles of the world♪
